the source of the aarch64 tables

finding
  Arm's AARCHMRS, in the package Arm publishes under the BSD 3-clause licence, may be vendored and may generate tables in an open
  source project. The licence permits redistribution and use in source and binary forms with or without modification, on the three
  conditions below. Every table generated from it is therefore generated from the vendored copy, and no fallback of our own
  spec-aligned tables is laid out.

